Squashed merge of 3 commits:
- runner: graph sequences v2 let a print read an earlier piece's value (d_mirror reuses q and r) (Jay Leaton)
- runner: an ELF build may use the whole translate deadline (bignum-10 no longer flips to unsupported) (Jay Leaton)
- runner: graph table test expects T1's binding to own the computed divisor (25); a string stays the refusal (Jay Leaton)
